/code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e2828442-1141-412a-a0dc-e0e96c7c788e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e2828442-1141-412a-a0dc-e0e96c7c788e\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a table inside the barracks of the <a href=\"/wiki/South_Span_Checkpoint\" title=\"South Span Checkpoint\">South Span Checkpoint</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-10&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;53</span>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>FUGITIVES AND BOUNTIES - Wyrm's Crossing Precinct \n</p><p><br>\nReminder - Unless the Manip says otherwise, he pays only half bounty if the fugitive is brought in dead.\n</p><p><br>\n- Tut <a href=\"/wiki/Phostlethwaite\" title=\"Phostlethwaite\">Phostlethwaite</a>, Breach of Promise - 10 gold \n</p><p>- The Masked Vinegaroon, Armed Robbery - 60 gold \n</p><p>- Dogberry Forceps, Fraudulent Impersonation - 12 gold \n</p><p>- Cantharides, Slander of the Archduke-Designate - 8 gold \n</p><p>- Doctor Henghyst, Murder (by slow poison) - 140 gold \n</p><p>- Umphbrogan, Ironhand Gnomes agent - 50 gold\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202033\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1605/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29654/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7710/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensiv